            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521320/extras/a4b84c111579cd9a62986c159c2c9221.avif?t=1523554432\" width=620 height=940 /></span><br><br>Final Warrior quest is a parody JRPG. Developed entirely in Japan, thus making it a true Japanese Role-Playing Game.  Recognizing the inherent foibles of the genre, Final Warrior Quest has tried to mitigate the annoyances while utilizing a humorous tone.<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    turn-based RPG combat system<br></li><li>    4-7 hours of gameplay<br></li><li>    original music that fits the style of 80s-90s JRPGs<br></li><li>    comedic fantasy setting<br></li><li>    weapon &amp; armor crafting<br></li><li>    near-meaningless class system<br></li><li>    random encounter toggle<br></li><li>    XBox 360 controller compatible</li></ul>",
